<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Streaming Lab</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-soft: #f4f9f6;
    --ink: #10241c;
    --muted: #5b6f65;
    --green: #178a4c;
    --green-deep: #0e5c33;
    --line: #d8e6dd;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 80px;
  }

  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .mark {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .who {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .hero {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px);
    animation: rise 0.6s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes rise {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23, 138, 76, 0.4); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(23, 138, 76, 0); }
  }

  video {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #0b1a12;
    display: block;
  }

  video:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--green);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  p.lede {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 20px 0 48px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .tiers {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .tier {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .tier-name { font-weight: 500; }

  .tier-role {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .tier-meta {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .security {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--green);
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .security ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .security li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 64px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  footer a {
    color: var(--green-deep);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero, .dot { animation: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .tier { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <span class="mark">Streaming Lab</span>
    <span class="who">Christian Ngiamba · Télécom Paris</span>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>En direct</div>
    <video id="video" controls muted autoplay playsinline></video>
    <p class="lede">Ce flux traverse un load balancer, un pare-feu applicatif et un serveur en subnet public, depuis une source isolée qui ne reçoit aucune connexion entrante.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Les trois tiers</h2>
  <div class="tiers">
    <div class="tier">
      <span class="tier-name">Frontend</span>
      <span class="tier-role">Reçoit le flux et le sert aux visiteurs</span>
      <span class="tier-meta">public · 80</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tier">
      <span class="tier-name">Streaming</span>
      <span class="tier-role">Génère et pousse la vidéo</span>
      <span class="tier-meta">privé · 1935</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tier">
      <span class="tier-name">Base de données</span>
      <span class="tier-role">Stocke les métadonnées</span>
      <span class="tier-meta">privé · 5432</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Sécurité de l'architecture</h2>
  <div class="security">
    <ul>
      <li>Segmentation réseau par groupes de sécurité référencés entre eux, jamais par plage d'IP ouverte</li>
      <li>Aucun port SSH exposé, l'administration passe par un tunnel EC2 Instance Connect Endpoint</li>
      <li>Le mot de passe de la base est lu depuis un coffre AWS, jamais écrit dans le code</li>
      <li>Un rôle IAM limité à une seule action sur une seule ressource, appliqué au frontend</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Terraform · Ansible · Docker · <a href="https://github.com/Mavchris/streaming-lab">code source</a>
  </footer>

</div>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/hls.js/1.5.13/hls.min.js"></script>
<script>
  const video = document.getElementById('video');
  const src = '/hls/stream.m3u8';
  if (Hls.isSupported()) {
    const hls = new Hls();
    hls.loadSource(src);
    hls.attachMedia(video);
  } else if (video.canPlayType('application/vnd.apple.mpegurl')) {
    video.src = src;
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
